  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ShopifyProductAdd.V2 \u2014 Import checklist\n\n1. Reconnect: Google Sheets, Shopify, Photoroom header auth\n2. HTTP Request1 (ImgBB): replace REPLACE_IMGBB_KEY after EVERY re-import\n3. Flow: Photoroom \u2192 ImgBB \u2192 **Wait for CDN ready** \u2192 Analyze image \u2192 AI listing\n4. **Wait for CDN ready** polls ImgBB URL until OpenAI can fetch it (fixes URL timeout)\n5. Trigger watches **Price** on sheet **product_template**\n6. Fill sheet input first \u2192 see yellow sticky note **Sheet Input Data**\n7. IF score < 90 \u2192 FAIL | score >= 90 \u2192 Shopify draft\n8. Set price and SKU: store set to 8kqexi-2j (change if your store differs)"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1800,
        -200
      ],
      "id": "cb2d4243-c189-4def-880f-1af89b44aaa6",
      "name": "Setup Instructions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ONE SHEET ONLY \u2014 product_template\n\nYou do NOT need a second spreadsheet.\n\n### YOU type (before run):\n| Column | Required? |\n| Product image URL | YES |\n| Description or Title | YES |\n| Price | YES (trigger) |\n| SKU | YES |\n| Vendor, Product category | recommended |\n\n### ADD 2 new column headers (row 1, end of sheet):\n| QA Status | AI Score |\n| (leave empty) | (leave empty) |\nWorkflow fills these automatically.\n\n### QA Status values (workflow writes):\n| Value | Meaning |\n| PASS | Score >= 90, Shopify draft created |\n| FAIL | Score < 90, no Shopify product |\n\nColumn order does NOT matter. Header names matter."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
